    <description>
     <narrative xml:lang="EN">1. Number of value chains piloting sustainability standards
2. Number of intervention models are developed and supported by the project  
3. Number of farmers trained
4. Number of MoU signed</narrative>
    </description>
    <baseline year="2021">
     <comment>
      <narrative xml:lang="EN">1. No baseline available for value chains piloting sustainability standards
2. No comprehensive mapping of farmers types, and AEZ in the pilot districts.
3. Training material is broadly available but seldom providing comprehensive knowledge and building understanding on options to move farmer&apos; practices towards sustainability
